{% comment %}
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  GUMFORCE ADVERTORIAL — PAGE TEMPLATE
  Ethan Walker — How I went from fat face to sharp jawline
  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  INSTALLATION (5 steps):

  1. Shopify admin → Online Store → Themes → Edit code
  2. In the Templates folder, click "Add a new template"
  3. Select: page  →  type: liquid  →  name it: advertorial-gumforce
     (Final filename will be: page.advertorial-gumforce.liquid)
  4. Replace the default content with this entire file. Save.
  5. Online Store → Pages → Add page
     - Title: anything (used for SEO/URL only, not displayed)
     - Right sidebar → Theme template → select "advertorial-gumforce"
     - Save & publish

  The page will be live at: yourstore.com/pages/[handle]

  All images, captions, and content are hardcoded. No setup required.

  ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
