    <h1 class="gf-headline">How I went from fat face to <span class="gf-headline-accent">sharp jawline</span> in a few weeks</h1>

    <p class="gf-lede">Notes from a 24-year-old who tried losing weight, then mewing for ten months, then everything else, before finding the thing that actually moved the needle.</p>

    <div class="gf-byline-bar">
      <div class="gf-byline-avatar">
        <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0961/8505/7585/files/ChatGPT_Image_20_mai_2026_12_10_56.png?v=1779270278&width=200" alt="Ethan Walker" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
