      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0961/8505/7585/files/image_3.png?v=1779268830&width=1600" alt="Ethan examining the GUMFORCE pouch" loading="lazy" />
      <p class="gf-img-caption">// Saturday night. February 24.</p>
    </div>

